sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant GOV as CMP-011 Governance Pack
    participant EVAL as CMP-008 Evaluation
    participant RUN as CMP-010 Benchmark Runner
    participant OBS as CMP-009 Observability
    participant DEP as Model/Retrieval/Tool Endpoint
    participant ORCH as CMP-003 Orchestrator

    GOV->>EVAL: Approve DATA-114 profile version + tokenizer identity
    EVAL->>RUN: INT-089 BenchmarkScenario (profile digest, seed, load pattern)
    RUN->>DEP: Synthetic or trace-replay requests
    DEP-->>RUN: Streaming tokens / tool and retrieval timings
    RUN->>OBS: INT-090 normalized per-request observations
    OBS-->>EVAL: DATA-119 observations + telemetry completeness
    EVAL->>EVAL: Percentiles, SLO-hypothesis attainment, cost and saturation analysis
    EVAL->>GOV: DATA-120 capacity envelope + evidence kind
    EVAL-->>ORCH: INT-093 advisory admission recommendation
    Note over ORCH: No automatic change to DATA-106. CMP-003 remains admission owner.
